{"type":"message","id":"0abc0fd4","parentId":"4625ffb2","timestamp":"2026-02-18T04:06:54.555Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-02-18 09:36 GMT+5:30] Create a speech-to-text skill for OpenClaw that can transcribe WhatsApp voice messages.\n\n**Skill name:** `transcribe`\n\n**Functionality:**\n- Accept an audio file path (from WhatsApp voice note, typically .ogg or .opus)\n- Transcribe to text using local Whisper (no external API)\n- Return the transcribed text\n\n**Implementation approach:**\n1. Check if Whisper (Python) or whisper.cpp is installed; if not, guide user to install one\n2. Use `exec` tool to run: `whisper <audio_file> --model tiny --language en --output_format txt`\n3. Capture stdout and return as transcript\n4. If Whisper not available, fall back to `web_fetch` calling OpenRouter's whisper model (if exists)\n\n**Skill structure:**\n- Create `skills/transcribe/` directory in workspace\n- Add `skill.json` manifest\n- Add a simple Python/Node script that wraps the transcription\n- Register the tool as `transcribe.transcribe_audio`\n- Provide instructions: how to receive WhatsApp voice, save to file, call skill\n\n**Deliverables:**\n- Skill code and manifest\n- Example usage in an agent (e.g., \"User sent voice, transcribe and respond\")\n- Documentation in `skills/transcribe/README.md`\n\n**Note:** WhatsApp voice messages are often .opus; Whisper handles them fine. Ensure the skill saves output somewhere and returns clean text.\n\nWrite skill to workspace root `skills/transcribe/` (or `D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw\\skills\\transcribe\\` if that's the skills dir). Make it plug-and-play."}],"timestamp":1771387614553}}
{"type":"message","id":"cf4292b4","parentId":"0abc0fd4","timestamp":"2026-02-18T04:06:57.872Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll create a speech-to-text skill for OpenClaw that can transcribe WhatsApp voice messages using local Whisper. Let me start by setting up the directory structure and implementing the skill.\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-b9fc5a5098d2c219","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p skills/transcribe"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"arcee-ai/trinity-large-preview:free","usage":{"input":12428,"output":60,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12488,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771387614555}}
